# The phonon modes of cubic ScF3 (Pm-3m, 4 atoms) at GM, X, M and R, from the
# FORCE_SETS of a 4x4x4 supercell. Writes phonon_visualize.html and
# band_vector.yaml. Open the page in a browser; the lowest level at R is the
# rigid rotation of the ScF6 octahedra (R4+, 1.42 THz, real in this harmonic
# calculation): phonon_visualize.html#q=R&mode=1&view=a shows it down the
# rotation axis of its first partner.
crystod-phonon --visualize -c 221_PPOSCAR_ScF3 --dim 4 4 4

* Structure *
  Space group: Pm-3m (#221)
  Formula: ScF3
  Supercell: 4 x 4 x 4 (FORCE_SETS)

* Band path *
  k path (seekpath): GM-X-M-GM-R-X | R-M  (306 q points)
  Labeled points: X, GM, R, M

