* Output files *
  Phonon band structure with eigenvectors written to: band_vector.yaml
  Phonon mode viewer written to: phonon_visualize.html

# The same page with the Sc-F bonds and the ScF6 octahedra, which follow the
# atoms in the animation (a page of its own; band_vector.yaml is written again,
# unchanged)
crystod-phonon --visualize -c 221_PPOSCAR_ScF3 --dim 4 4 4 --bond Sc F 2.3 -o phonon_visualize_bond.html

# The R point only (one mode table in the terminal, one q button on the page)
crystod-phonon --visualize -c 221_PPOSCAR_ScF3 --dim 4 4 4 --qpoint R -o phonon_visualize_R.html
